// https://jobs.apploi.com/view/770506, not .../770506?utm_campaign=jobs_snippet&_=1784956010.8110137
// https://example.bamboohr.com/careers/507, not .../507?euidtkncn=htXXP2zqOPEtdOQ
// Dropped: analytics, cache-busters, UI-language, board-skin and referrer params, plus any param
